# Text is LF everywhere (issue I24, slides/docs/patterns/issues.md): Git for
# Windows' core.autocrlf=true otherwise warns on every file and breaks sh hooks.
* text=auto eol=lf
# cmd.exe needs CRLF: an LF-only .bat can lose its labels (goto, call :x).
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.onnx binary
*.tflite binary
# The films' tracked files keep their bytes, as under film/ (film/.gitattributes):
# film.yaml is committed by every render and read back by `film undo`.
projects/** -text
